<title>LATVIA: ROTA 1 COMPANY MAKES 1996 LOSS.</title>
<headline>ROTA 1 COMPANY MAKES 1996 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian printing company Rota One made a 1996 net loss of 156,786 lats on turnover of 477,747 lats, the stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement of Rota's results that gross profit came to 55,605 lats, adminstrative expenses were 71,499 lats and that the loss before tax was 13,748 lats.</p>
<p>The bourse also said that Rota had assets of 882,825 lats. No comparative figures for 1995 were provided.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
